cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GP_ELITE, please cite it as below."
title: "GP_ELITE: Symbolic regression by genetic programming"
abstract: >-
  Pure-Python symbolic regression: genetic programming with island
  parallelism, Levenberg-Marquardt constant optimization, multi-restart
  with merged candidate archives, a complexity/accuracy Pareto front, and
  an optional dimensionally-constrained search mode driven by the physical
  units of the input columns.
authors:
  - family-names: Hakou
    given-names: Sabri
type: software
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-07-27
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ariel95500-create/gp-elite"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/gp-elite/"
keywords:
  - symbolic regression
  - genetic programming
  - interpretable machine learning
  - equation discovery
  - dimensional analysis

